{
  "_asdp_note": "ROLLBACK RECORD ONLY — this workflow was deleted from the live n8n instance on 2026-08-14 per Founder direction: no error is recorded to Applicant Records anymore (error_detail column deleted from the sheet). With its only job (writing error_detail) removed, Error Handling had nothing left to do, so it was removed too, not left as a no-op sub-workflow call — matching ADR-0021/0024's monolithic/lean-by-default bias. All 5 W1 call sites now go straight from their failure-detecting IF/Set node to the corresponding Respond to Webhook node. This file is the exact last-deployed definition, kept for traceability/rollback only.",
